If barefoot shoes tend to look too wide to you, our FELIX model is a great choice, thanks to its toe design, which visually narrows the shoe. Its clean cut is easy to style, and the lacing allows for an adjustable fit.&nbsp;Made from naturally breathable hemp fibre, they offer a healthier choice for everyday wear.&nbsp;

